# Build output (regenerable).
# A stray tarball from an earlier `helm package` would otherwise be packaged
# into the next one.
*.tgz

# CI snapshot fixtures stay out of the tarball. They are rendered output of
# this chart, regenerated and diffed by the helm-snapshot job, so they are a
# test input rather than chart content that users need.
tests/
